Removes Helium's onboarding page (helium://setup) from the build.

Helium's onboarding is a separately downloaded, Helium-branded web app that
asks for consent to Helium's hosted services. Rooster doesn't fetch it and
keeps those services off, so the page and its first-run redirect are dropped.
The onboarding-page patch itself stays applied because later Helium patches
are written against the code it adds (prefs, settings strings).

